  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������I have to go! I've gotta do this,\nfor everyone's sake!",
      "_offset": 3698,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Uh-huh. Trying to look cool?",
      "_offset": 3761,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Who's there?",
      "_offset": 3790,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "So you wanna go up that mountain\nall by yourself?",
      "_offset": 3803,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Gomamon! Don't try to stop me!",
      "_offset": 3853,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Okay.",
      "_offset": 3884,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "And don't follow me! I'm doing\nthis on my own!",
      "_offset": 3890,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Well, I've got some of business of\nmy own on that mountain.",
      "_offset": 3937,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Suit yourself!",
      "_offset": 3997,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Seriously, Jou, be honest. You'd \nbe completely lost trying to go up\nthere alone, wouldn't you?",
      "_offset": 4012,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Don't be stupid!",
      "_offset": 4108,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Jou! That's the wrong way!",
      "_offset": 4125,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I-I was about to turn back!",
      "_offset": 4152,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Anyway, this is a really big\nmountain.",
      "_offset": 4180,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Giving up already?",
      "_offset": 4219,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Not at all!",
      "_offset": 4238,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Let's take a break for bit! We've\nprobably got at least half the\nmountain left.",
      "_offset": 4250,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "You're not doing half bad, Jou!",
      "_offset": 4330,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "You too, Gomamon!",
      "_offset": 4362,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "What's that?!",
      "_offset": 4380,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "An earthquake?!",
      "_offset": 4394,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Those black gears!",
      "_offset": 4410,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Why are they coming out of there?\nLet's go check it out! Maybe we'll\nfigure something out!",
      "_offset": 4429,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 4520,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I'm sure there was something weird\ngoing on around here. Let's look a\nlittle closer!",
      "_offset": 4526,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Wait! What's that? That sound...",
      "_offset": 4611,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "It's Unimon! He's a really wise\nand peaceful Digimon!",
      "_offset": 4644,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "We should hide! You haven't\nexactly been giving us reliable \ninformation on Digimon so far.",
      "_offset": 4698,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Maybe so, but...",
      "_offset": 4790,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "He's drinking water! So that's\nwhat he was doing.",
      "_offset": 4807,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "I told you it'd be fine! Let's get\na closer look!",
      "_offset": 4857,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "This is bad!",
      "_offset": 4907,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "His eyes are going crazy.",
      "_offset": 4920,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Mmm! I slept well! I wonder if\nJou's up yet...",
      "_offset": 4946,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "\"I'll be back soon. Stay here and\nwait for me. Jou.\"",
      "_offset": 4993,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "He didn't go to Infinity Mountain\nby himself, did he?! This is bad!\nEveryone, get up!",
      "_offset": 5046,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Jou went to Infinity Mountain\nalone?",
      "_offset": 5132,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "That's what it looks like. What\nshould we do?",
      "_offset": 5169,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Okay, there's only one thing to\ndo! I'm going after him!",
